stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> placed: OrderPlaced
    placed --> awaiting_payment: StockReserved
    placed --> rejected: OrderRejected
    awaiting_payment --> confirmed: PaymentCaptured
    awaiting_payment --> payment_failed: PaymentDeclined
    awaiting_payment --> expired: ReservationExpired
    confirmed --> shipped: OrderShipped
    confirmed --> cancelled: OrderCancelled
    rejected --> [*]
    shipped --> [*]
    note right of placed
        Product service has not
        answered yet. Reconciled
        automatically.
    end note
    note right of awaiting_payment
        Stock is held, the Payment
        service has not answered.
        Retried until it does, or
        until the time limit.
    end note
    note right of cancelled
        Ending without the goods
        being used leaves a debt.
        All three owe the stock back.
        Expired and cancelled also
        owe a void of the charge.
    end note
